;Bounty Board:
;
;  === Agarzikil (17,5) ===
;
;  Travelers passing through the mountain of Izilzarak Fireheart
;  Peak have nowhere to rest. The mayor of Agarzikil offers a bounty
;  to any faction that builds an Inn there. The site lies 2 hexes
;  southeast of Agarzikil.
;  Reward: 1 Bounty Token. Posted: Year 7, November (turn 83).
;  Expires: Year 8, November (turn 95).
;
;  In the ocean of Hoofman Ocean roams the Elder Merfolk (5394). The
;  mayor of Agarzikil offers a bounty for its defeat!
;  Reward: 2 Bounty Tokens. Posted: Year 7, February (turn 74).
;  Expires: Year 8, February (turn 86).
;
;  The Lair in Ibizzikil Nan harbors Elder Living Trees. The mayor
;  of Agarzikil seeks adventurers to clear it!
;  Reward: 3 Bounty Tokens. Posted: Year 7, January (turn 73).
;  Expires: Year 8, January (turn 85).
;
;  A Dark Burrow has appeared near Agarzikil. Somewhere within lurks
;  Elder Warden (8358). The mayor of Agarzikil seeks heroes to storm
;  the dungeon!
;  Reward: 6 Bounty Tokens. Posted: Year 7, April (turn 76).
;  Entrance closes: Year 8, April (turn 88).
;  Expires: Year 8, April (turn 88).
